statement:
Determine the leading-order low-energy constant $g_{
u}^{NN}$ of the $\mathrm{nn} 	o \mathrm{pp}\,\mathrm{e}\,\mathrm{e}$ contact operator in chiral EFT (Cirigliano et al., PRL 120, 202001, 2018), from a lattice QCD calculation of the $\mathrm{nn} 	o \mathrm{pp}$ amplitude or from the dispersive estimate (Cirigliano et al., PRL 126, 172002, 2021). Answer: $g_{
u}^{NN}$ with 20 percent uncertainty in a stated regulator scheme, and its effect on $M^{0
u}$ for 76Ge and 136Xe.
